OL,3,ARussian glide bomb attack on
OL,4,AZaporizhzhia kills at least 15 people
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussia has attacked the Ukrainian city
OL,7,Fof Zaporizhzhia with five glide bombs,
OL,8,Fkilling at least 15 people including
OL,9,Fthree children, President Volodymyr
OL,10,FZelensky and emergency services have
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FThe glide bombs hit residential
OL,14,Fbuildings in the south-eastern city. At
OL,15,Fleast 16 other people were injured in
OL,16,Fthe attack, with more still missing and
OL,17,Fbelieved to be under the rubble after
OL,18,Fthe strike on Saturday morning.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
